  "body": "On macOS, `.DS_Store` files are generated by Finder for... reasons (https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/.DS_Store)\n\nOnce generated, these are considered by git as added files. This prevents a `git pull` of newer commits unless the files are manually removed or `git stash`ed first.\n\n ",
